  "notes": "Tailwind-slate ChatGPT-style clone focused on speech: mic and speaker toggle icons above the composer, red-orange gradient Record button next to violet gradient Send. Avatars are plain gradient circles (purple-pink for user, yellow-green for assistant) instead of icons. The thread sits in a 1px-bordered rounded box rather than open canvas. Sidebar items have a colored dot per conversation (category-ish) or a yellow star when liked, a light grey count pill, and the active item gets a slate highlight. Hover on a message shows speak/delete/copy mini toolbar; hover on a conversation shows a kebab with Like/Edit/Delete. Gradient waveform logo above a gradient-text wordmark."
